   align-items: end, that extra height pushes the whole select block (label
   + control) upward relative to its neighbors instead of just growing the
   control downward. Trim it to 32px so every field in the row shares one
   box height and one label baseline. */
.cus-worksheet-toolbar .ds-uui-select__control button > span,
